  "description_ja": "山寺をスタートし、天童・中山・山辺・上山など5市町村を巡るウルトラ大会。桜と雪景色の風景、観光名所や温泉、山形の食を楽しみながら走れる。エイドではジンギスカンやお蕎麦、のし梅などを提供し、ゴール後には芋煮を提供する予定。",
  "description_en": "An ultra-distance event starting at Yamadera and passing through five municipalities including Tendo, Nakayama, Yamanobe and Kaminoyama. Runners enjoy scenery of cherry blossoms and snow, sightseeing spots, hot springs and Yamagata cuisine. Aid stations offer Genghis Khan lamb, soba and noshiume sweets, and imoni (taro stew) is planned for finishers.",
